  subgraph TEACH["Admin who also teaches"]
    C1["Where admins find it:<br/>1 Setup step Add a tutor, link I teach too<br/>2 Tutors empty state button<br/>3 Profile settings CFG-P<br/>4 Join as an admin? dialog link, decision D-02"] --> C2["I teach too ON<br/>TM-10"]
    C2 --> C3["Admin appears in Tutors with Admin chip<br/>tutor choices in wizards and Reassign<br/>reminders and attendance count as Tutor"]
